{'symbol': 'DLTR', 'date': '2022-04-06 07:30:00', 'title': 'DOLLAR TREE BOARD OF DIRECTORS ANNOUNCES CORPORATE GOVERNANCE ENHANCEMENTS', 'text': "CHESAPEAKE, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--DOLLAR TREE, INC. (NASDAQ: DLTR) (“DOLLAR TREE” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS (THE “BOARD”) HAS UNANIMOUSLY APPROVED AMENDMENTS TO THE COMPANY'S AMENDED AND RESTATED BY-LAWS (THE “BY-LAWS”) AND CORPORATE GOVERNANCE GUIDELINES IN ORDER TO STRENGTHEN STOCKHOLDER RIGHTS AND ENHANCE THE ABILITY OF STOCKHOLDERS TO ENGAGE WITH THE COMPANY. THE COMPANY AMENDED ITS BY-LAWS TO MOVE THE ADVANCE NOTICE TIME PERIOD FOR SHAREHOLDER NOMINATION"}